Attribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Marsa is derived from canvas-drop (https://github.com/markpasternak/canvas-drop),
Copyright (c) 2026 canvas-drop contributors, licensed under the MIT License.
The upstream copyright and permission notice are retained in LICENSE.

Adapted pieces (modified for Marsa): upload path normalization and zip-slip
guard (src/paths.ts), ZIP ingestion with zip-bomb guards (src/ingest.ts),
the MIME map (src/mime.ts) and the in-process rate-limiter design
(src/rate-limit.ts).

